{{also|måndag}}
==Danish==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|da}} {{term|mánadagr|lang=non}}, from late {{etyl|gem-pro|da}} {{m|gem-pro|*mēniniz dagaz}}, a calque of Latin {{term|dies lunae|lang=la}}. Compare Norwegian Bokmål {{term|mandag|lang=nb}}, Swedish and Norwegian Nynorsk {{term|måndag|lang=nn}}, Icelandic {{term|mánudagur|lang=is}}, Faroese {{term|mánadagur|lang=fo}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈmanˀda/|lang=da}}
* {{rhymes|a|lang=da}}

===Noun===
{{da-noun|en|e}}

# [[Monday]]

====Inflection====
{{da-noun-infl|en|e}}

===See also===
{{list:days of the week/da}}

[[Category:da:Days of the week]]

